  "finding": "WriteOffProposal has no predecessor/supersedes/corrects/replacement source relation or structured correction context. WriteOffReversal links only to old WriteOffDecision. Obligation is immutable and identifies upstream Billing/Procurement/Payroll source, not write-off replacement. SourceRecognitionDraft.predecessor retains downstream Accounting lineage, not AP/AR source correction authority. WorkflowInstance and audit are coordination/evidence; neither is approved write-off business authority.",
  "minimum_resolution": "Authorize minimum additive AP/AR-owned write-off correction/replacement source-lineage persistence and bounded Development/Non-Production migration, with migration-only canonical prompt amendment and manifest rehash; alternatively provide an approved existing no-migration source-lineage contract. No additional business/recognition/approval defaults inferred.",
  "catalog_review": "No migration blocker asserted solely from workflow catalog absence: existing SystemCatalogAdmin can provision code-registered types.",
  "database_mutations": false,
  "product_mutations": false
}
